# Other git repos a pump task may target with `repo: /abs/path` (dv-ebf7).
#
# One absolute path per line, the repo's top level; `#` starts a comment.
# Edited by hand only — nothing writes to this file. Each line lets an
# unattended agent get a worktree and a `pump/<id>` branch in that repo, so
# adding one is a deliberate act, like `pump_allow`.
#
# This repo (devvy_bot) is always allowed and needs no line. A task whose repo
# is not listed goes `pump: blocked`; add the line, then `taskpump unblock <id>`.
